From ff0010dd72db57d6b970720cc7e93e772208627c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fxzx micah <48860358+fxzxmicah@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:02:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] extensions-tool: Separate development commands from extension
 management

Build create, pack and upload in a separate module, keeping management commands independent of the extension development toolchain. Load the module only for development commands or command discovery, preserving the existing command-line interface.

Reuse the command helpers in the executable, keep templates in the development module, and split completion and manual content along the same boundary. Build both components under the existing extensions_tool option so distributions can package the development module separately.
