+## Development commands
+The `create`, `pack` and `upload` commands are provided by an optional module.
+Distributions can package it separately from the management commands. Installing
+the module also adds these commands to the command-line help and completion.
+Its manual is `gnome-extensions-development(1)`; packaging translations requires
+gettext's `msgfmt` program.
